---
import '../../../domains/games/renju/playroom.css';
import '../../../domains/games/renju/wardrobe-page.css';
import '../../../domains/games/styles/door.css';
import DoorIcon from '../../../domains/games/components/DoorIcon.astro';
import SeoHead from '../../../shared/components/SeoHead.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#142c35" />
    <title>꾸미기 스튜디오 · 오목마루 — Extransload</title>
    <SeoHead title="꾸미기 스튜디오 · 오목마루 — Extransload" description="무료 돌과 아바타, 바둑판, 승리 연출을 3D로 미리 보고 꾸미세요" canonicalPath="/playroom/omokmaru/wardrobe/" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
  </head>
  <body class="wardrobe-page">
    <header class="studio-top">
      <a class="door-control" href="/playroom/omokmaru/" aria-label="오목마루 로비로 돌아가기" title="오목마루로 돌아가기"><DoorIcon /></a>
      <a class="studio-top-brand" href="/playroom/omokmaru/">OMOKMARU <span>/</span> WARDROBE</a>
      <span class="studio-free">ALL FREE</span>
    </header>
    <main class="studio-shell">
      <div class="studio-intro"><span class="studio-eyebrow">YOUR GAME, YOUR STYLE</span><h1 id="studio-title">꾸미기 스튜디오</h1><p>돌 하나부터 승리의 순간까지 마음에 드는 모습으로 꾸며 보세요. 모든 디자인은 무료이며 내 화면에만 적용됩니다.</p></div>
      <section class="studio-editor" aria-labelledby="studio-title">
        <nav class="studio-tabs" aria-label="꾸미기 종류">
          <button type="button" data-category="stone" aria-pressed="true"><span>●</span> 돌</button>
          <button type="button" data-category="avatar" aria-pressed="false"><span>◕</span> 아바타</button>
          <button type="button" data-category="accessory" aria-pressed="false"><span>♛</span> 장식</button>
          <button type="button" data-category="board" aria-pressed="false"><span>▦</span> 바둑판</button>
          <button type="button" data-category="victory" aria-pressed="false"><span>✦</span> 승리 연출</button>
        </nav>
        <div class="studio-list-heading"><div><span id="studio-category-kicker">STONE COLLECTION</span><h2 id="studio-category-title">돌 재질</h2></div><span id="studio-count">01 / 05</span></div>
        <div id="studio-items" class="studio-items" aria-label="무료 디자인 목록"></div>
        <div class="studio-sets"><div class="studio-sets-heading"><div><span>MY LOOKS</span><h2>내 세트</h2></div><button id="studio-random" class="studio-text-button" type="button">↝ 무작위 조합</button></div><p>마음에 드는 조합을 3개까지 저장하고 언제든 다시 적용하세요.</p><div id="studio-slots" class="studio-slots"></div><button id="studio-default" class="studio-text-button" type="button">기본 디자인으로 되돌리기</button></div>
      </section>
      <section class="studio-preview" aria-label="3D 미리보기">
        <div class="studio-preview-top"><div><span class="studio-eyebrow">LIVE PREVIEW</span><h2>나의 오목마루</h2></div><span id="studio-save-status" role="status">자동 저장됨</span></div>
        <div class="studio-stage"><div id="studio-canvas" class="canvas"></div><div id="studio-stage-label" class="studio-stage-label">돌 회전 · 왼쪽 버튼이나 손가락으로 드래그</div></div>
        <div class="studio-preview-controls">
          <div class="studio-seats" role="group" aria-label="미리 볼 돌 색"><button type="button" data-seat="black" aria-pressed="true"><i class="studio-seat-stone black"></i> 흑돌 모습</button><button type="button" data-seat="white" aria-pressed="false"><i class="studio-seat-stone white"></i> 백돌 모습</button></div>
          <div class="studio-camera" role="group" aria-label="미리보기 시점"><button id="studio-view" type="button" title="위에서 보기" aria-label="위에서 보기">▦</button><button id="studio-zoom-in" type="button" title="확대" aria-label="확대">＋</button><button id="studio-zoom-out" type="button" title="축소" aria-label="축소">−</button><button id="studio-reset-view" type="button" title="시점 초기화" aria-label="시점 초기화">↺</button></div>
        </div>
        <div id="studio-preview-actions" class="studio-preview-actions" hidden><button id="studio-victory" class="studio-play-button" type="button">↻ 승리 연출 다시 보기</button></div>
        <div class="studio-current"><span>현재 조합</span><strong id="studio-current-label"></strong></div>
        <div class="studio-links"><a href="/playroom/omokmaru/solo/">AI 대국에서 사용 ↗</a><a href="/playroom/omokmaru/">온라인 대국에서 사용 ↗</a></div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <script>import '../../../domains/games/renju/wardrobe-page';</script>
  </body>
</html>
